        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Price of Theft, an atmospheric first-person psychological horror game where reality and madness intertwine within the walls of an old estate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore a house where strange rituals were once performed. Every room holds its own secrets, and around every corner lies something best left undisturbed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your surroundings, collect notes and objects, and solve logic and sound puzzles. Immerse yourself in the story left behind by the house's inhabitants and reconstruct the chain of events that led to the horror that still lingers within these walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Price of Theft isn't just terrifying—it makes you question the boundaries between fear, guilt, and salvation. It's important not only to survive, but also to understand why you ended up here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric first-person horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast estate with numerous secrets and locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notes, diaries, and artifacts that reveal the story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive soundscapes that influence perception</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screamers and frightening scenes integrated into the narrative</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logical and audio puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear exploration and multiple endings</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Price of Theft, an atmospheric first-person psychological horror game where reality and madness intertwine within the walls of an old estate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore a house where strange rituals were once performed. Every room holds its own secrets, and around every corner lies something best left undisturbed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your surroundings, collect notes and objects, and solve logic and sound puzzles. Immerse yourself in the story left behind by the house's inhabitants and reconstruct the chain of events that led to the horror that still lingers within these walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Price of Theft isn't just terrifying—it makes you question the boundaries between fear, guilt, and salvation. It's important not only to survive, but also to understand why you ended up here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric first-person horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast estate with numerous secrets and locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notes, diaries, and artifacts that reveal the story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive soundscapes that influence perception</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screamers and frightening scenes integrated into the narrative</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logical and audio puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear exploration and multiple endings</p>",
